#Test http requests

### Get all items
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/items

### Get item by id
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/items/1

### Post new item
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/items/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"posted item"
}

### Delete item by id
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/items/1

### Modify existing item by id
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"modified item"
}

### Test addition
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/calculate/add/5/5

### Test subtraction
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/calculate/subtract/5/5

### Test multiplication
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/calculate/multiply/5/5

### Test division
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/calculate/divide/5/5